notes.notes:
Wow, is that a patch note?

Small steps to make the game more comfortable for all players:

 All animations have been optimised. In short, now they work faster;
 Transitions between episodes have become smoother, transition colours have been adjusted;
 Skipping dialogues is now more comfortable;
 Places where interface elements overlap have been found and fixed;
 Places where you can get stuck are even less;
 Other minor edits have been made.


We have a lot of plans for the future of Torn Away, stay with Asya and perelesoq, friends!

Mini update report for you:


 Gamepad controls in mini-games have been improved;
 Jump sections have been made more comfortable;
 Item interaction issues at different resolutions have been fixed;
 Asya no longer gets stuck in the jump and in doors;
 Fridge mini-game improved;
 Bullet segments have become simpler;
 Locations now take up less memory space;
 Korean localization improved;
 Other minor bugs fixed.


There's a big patch coming that will make the gameplay even more enjoyable!

Enjoy Torn Away, friends
